      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>High-output military-grade leg actuators with full-body kinetic assist, including hip, knee, and ankle joints that work in concert to multiply the wearer's natural stride length and frequency. The system includes a combat movement VI that anticipates directional changes and pre-loads actuator tension, making the suit feel almost weightless during sprints and direction changes. Increases your Speed by 10 feet.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> - Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p><hr/><p><em>Installation: Drag it onto armor in your inventory to install it. Its bonus applies while the armor it is installed in is worn. </em></p>"
